<description>&lt;p&gt;Ansar al-Sunna militants are advancing in Cabo Delgado, forcing peasant farmers to abandon fields as insurgents approach villages. The EU has extended its military training mission and aid to Mozambique through 2028, while a US company has begun training and equipping Mozambican police in the province. A suspected hitman was arrested for the murder of a Mozambican bishop, indicating targeted attacks on religious leaders. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPdVg4TG9pNTJCUFhKOTlmV0NTblI1SGF1QkFxcG14OVA4eWhzSUEwXzduRnZsbDVxVkg1Q055c3FxWHFGei15OHZXSVJ6MFI0MDVYdEZyeWtLZ2dQRXFQMmJrT1RkM29FSTBPaEZCamhZMmdlaXR2NVNYZ0c5aWwyTEpVT09BaV9UN3RuUWNXNW1GUjFOVUdMNF81Y19rOGpscDZpWnRSQkpJcElocU1rcDVzaFNqelVJQTNONnlHcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQTXh6dzkxR1VUNFhIRVpsY3NEV2tuYXU0WDRFZjd1OTlZYmVQTGJZN0EzT2trTjhoU2lEckJsUHBDMWdIZjBEbUVZbXEyYkJXX2F2dGNGaDBtb1pSelJMTl9nREVOdFIweTJMS0lZcXZYMjNuVkJDSDc3MWtubWlfY25pTkZoZDE5cUlDcXo2aHBPZGVmYUVNYm8xUFo?oc=5&quot;&gt;News24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE53RUs3LU45bWhLV0FoQnNhVlJ3VkM5bUhSODlaejZrUGpPeUExczh1VUZhbDhWbXVkV3BiWVBSU0xuRFJQUkF4cDdrNlpmRDVqb05aVjBMWVM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Keen On America&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFA5STF0N1J1QzBsMFNsRkFTRTVhd1REV2NkeHRZTkJEWkpvTlZlc0kxYkZEdmUycDRpcWhPVHVjckQxY1Rha0xGSDNlZXd2TUw1ZnFWZS1FNUdJeWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPSTd3S0g2enZSS09zQUk3VkdoMDNfTFhXc291RUQ1N1hMbkVlRkx2MWhOQUlieFhIZFFLcDdtdmtrRkd5eHROZmtNcFpLOXhtNFo5WjFaTHVaVGpDcXVLeVo2QWEwQ1c4TzQxSzdEQndQeUhDY2o4MWF3VUszWlc2TUxVb29QSlZ